graph TD
    subgraph Event Sourcing & State
        T[Trigger] --> C[Command]
        C --> CV[Constraint Validation]
        CV --> ECr[Event Creation]
        ECr --> ES[(Event Store)]
        ES --> PW[Projection Worker]
        PW --> SP[(State Projection)]
        SP --> RM[(Read Models)]
    end

    subgraph Snapshot & Replay
        ES --> SB[Snapshot Builder]
        SB --> SS[(Snapshot Store)]
        CL[Case Load] --> SS
        CL -->|Replay Remaining| ES
    end

    subgraph Action & Execution
        ES -->|Event Stream| ACr[Action Creation]
        ACr --> A[Action]
        A --> EQ[Execution Queue]
        EQ --> BC[Budget Check]
        BC --> CB[Circuit Breaker Check]
        CB --> E[Execution]
        E --> Cap[Capability]
        Cap --> EP[External Provider]
    end

    subgraph Scheduling & Availability
        Sched[Scheduler] --> QA[Query Availability]
        QA --> CSE[Create ScheduledEvent]
        CSE --> C
    end

    subgraph Evidence Invalidation
        EIE[EvidenceInvalidated Event] --> CRE[Constraint Re-Evaluation]
        CRE --> Sus[Case Suspended/Non-Compliant]
    end

    subgraph Operations & Incidents
        EP -.-> I[Incident]
        I --> OS[Operational Supervisor]
        I --> CBus[Command Bus]
        I --> AppE[Approval Engine]
        I -- Pause/Resume --> EQ
    end
